    },
    "バックアップした時点の状態に戻します。バックアップにない今のファイルは削除されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Returns to how things were when the backup was made. Current files not in the backup will be deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复到备份时的状态。备份中没有的现有文件将被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バックアップと復元の両方に適用されます。オフにすると速くなりますが、正しく転送できたかの確認を省きます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to both backups and restores. Turning this off is faster but skips checking that the transfer was correct."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时适用于备份和恢复。关闭后速度更快，但会跳过传输是否正确的检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
